title: FP_OneSiteBind_Fit
type: software
message: >-
  If you use this script, please cite it as below. If you use the
  FP_OneSiteBind fitting model in published research, please also cite the
  referenced article.
authors:
  - family-names: Mymrikov
    given-names: Evgeny V.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/emymrikov/FP_OneSiteBind_Fit"
keywords:
  - fluorescence anisotropy
  - equilibrium binding
  - binding affinity
  - OriginPro
  - curve fitting
  - Kd
abstract: >-
  An OriginPro Python script for batch fitting of fluorescence anisotropy
  binding data with the user-defined fitting function FP_OneSiteBind.
  Concatenated fitting of replicate Y columns per sample with automatic
  report parsing, summary tables, and styled per-sample graphs.
